WEBVTT

39:39.487 --> 39:42.406
(GASPS) Very good, Khaleesi.

39:42.531 --> 39:44.533
Out there he is the mighty khal,

39:45.201 --> 39:48.537
but in this tent, he belongs to you.

39:49.330 --> 39:50.748
I... I don't think

39:50.873 --> 39:53.376
that this is the Dothraki way.

39:53.501 --> 39:55.544
If he wanted the Dothraki way,

39:56.379 --> 39:58.506
why did he marry you?
